# main branch: the live app at https://app.runmitra.in, on the API at
# https://api.runmitra.in. Read by `npm run build` (the website on Vercel, and
# the Android app). Not secret: these values end up inside the built app.
#
# The website ignores VITE_API_URL: it calls /api on its own address, which
# vercel.json forwards to the right API. The Android app calls this directly.
VITE_API_URL=https://api.runmitra.in/api
# Where shared and scanned links (matches, team joins, player QR codes) open.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://app.runmitra.in
